last from beginning to end the  next dc project coming out is the batman  and the company has a really solid year  by the looks of it overall i'm sure you  can guess i love the show and because of  that it gets a 9 out of 10. i'd of  course love to hear your thoughts so  make sure you comment below and let me  know we're running a competition right  now and giving away three copies of the  june box set on the 28th of feb and all  you have to do to be on the chance of  winning is like the video make sure you  subscribe with notifications on and  trouble comment below with your thoughts  on the finale if you pick the comments  at random at the end of the month and  the winners of the last one are on  screen right now so if that's you then  message me on twitter at heavyspoilers  if you want something else to watch then  make sure you check out our breakdown of  the doctor strange trailer which will be  linked on screen right now we go over  all the easter eggs in it and give our  theories on what could be happening in  the movie so definitely go check it out  right after this without the way thank  you for seeing through the video i've  been paul and i'll see you next time  take care peace maker
 

